      "average_instruments": 14.69,
      "coverage": 0.9793,
      "turnover_proxy": 0.199785,
      "max_abs_library_correlation": null
    },
    "regime_notes": "10-day rank IC after orienting the tested negative reversal signal into positive momentum orientation. Regime means: 2020-2022 +0.047334, 2023-2024 -0.034658, 2025-2026 +0.011129, 2027-2028 +0.075171, 2029 YTD -0.036965. The sign is regime-dependent; use conservatively and audit redundancy.",
